# Life Admin — Architecture Specification

## 1. Architecture Goal

Use a simple, maintainable full-stack Next.js architecture that keeps UI, API, validation, database access, and business logic separated.

## 2. Technology Stack

- Next.js 16
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM
- Zod
- Authentication/session solution compatible with Next.js
- Git
- GitHub
- Vercel or another suitable Next.js hosting platform
- Optional AI SDK/provider

## 3. High-Level Architecture

Browser
  |
  v
Next.js App Router
  |
  +--> Server Components
  |       |
  |       +--> Service layer
  |               |
  |               +--> Prisma
  |
  +--> Client Components
  |       |
  |       +--> API routes / server actions as appropriate
  |
  +--> Route Handlers
          |
          +--> Authentication
          +--> Zod validation
          +--> Service layer
                  |
                  +--> Prisma
                          |
                          v
                      PostgreSQL

